.TH tuodf n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tuodf \- create and read simple OpenDocument Text files.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
package require tclutils::tuodf
.fi
.SH COMMANDS
.nf
::tclutils::tuodf::createText odtFile paragraphs ?options?
::tclutils::tuodf::text odtFile
::tclutils::tuodf::paragraphs odtFile
::tclutils::tuodf::part odtFile name
::tclutils::tuodf::parts odtFile
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Creates and reads simple paragraph based ODT files using pure Tcl and tuzip.
The generated container stores mimetype first and uncompressed.
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
-title text       write dc:title into meta.xml
-creator text     write dc:creator into meta.xml
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
tclutils(n), tuzip(n), tuxml(n)
